menuconfig BLUFI_PROVISIONING_ENABLED
    bool "BluFi (BLE) WiFi provisioning"
    default y
    select BT_ENABLED
    select BT_BLE_BLUFI_ENABLE
    help
        Enables the BluFi (BLE) provisioning component, usable from the EspBlufi
        mobile app or the BlufiEsp32WeChat WeChat mini-program
        (https://github.com/xuhongv/BlufiEsp32WeChat).

        Enabling this pulls in the Bluetooth (Bluedroid) stack, which reserves
        about 60 KB of SRAM for the lifetime of the firmware while BLE is up.
        Set it to "n" to strip BLE entirely and reclaim that memory.
